{"id":"en_my-celebrity-boyfriend-killed-me","title":"My Celebrity Boyfriend Killed Me","titleEn":"My Celebrity Boyfriend Killed Me","description":"Claire Evens dreams of an acting career and carries on a hidden romance with producer Mitch Sterling. When she becomes pregnant, his reaction turns violent and he pushes her toward an abortion. Cast out and devastated, she finds support in Alex, a screenwriter still struggling to make his name. A threat to tell the press about the pregnancy makes Mitch soften, and Claire mistakes this for a reconciliation, going out with him even though Alex warns her against it. Mitch then betrays her, attempting to kill both her and the unborn child in horrifying fashion. Alex sees it happen and collapses before help arrives. Two decades on, Alex has become a celebrated screenwriter, while Claire's orphaned daughter Clara has grown into a famous actress. Both are in demand across the industry, and both i","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/306223b3b66c6ff0/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/306223b3b66c6ff0/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Love-Torture","Revenge","Love-Torture","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9n3q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-celebrity-boyfriend-killed-me_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9n3q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-celebrity-boyfriend-killed-me_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9n3q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-celebrity-boyfriend-killed-me_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumb